ldari","name":"Strength from Death","turn":"either","phase":[2,4],"units":[],"answer":"Imported source needs checking. The Fade Back branch adds another move without saying whether it replaces or modifies the normal manoeuvre. Check its interaction and eligible units.","status":"admin-reviewed","window":"act","faction":"Aeldari","summary":"Lethal Intent: at the opponent’s Shooting-phase end, if a friendly YNNARI unit died that phase, select friendly YNNARI INFANTRY or MOUNTED that was within 6 inches of your destroyed unit; it may make a Normal move up to D6+1 inches. Lethal Surge: once per turn, YNNARI using Fade Back may surge D6+1 inches instead of making a Normal move. Lethal Reprisal: at either Fight-phase start, choose a friendly non-TITANIC YNNARI unit below Starting Strength to gain Fights First for the phase.","timings":[{"turn":"opponent","phase":[2],"window":"end"},{"turn":"opponent","phase":[2],"window":"react"},{"turn":"either","phase":[4],"window":"start"}],"category":"army","expanded":true,"question":"What needs checking before using Strength from Death?","sourceIds":["catalog","admin"],"sourceUrl":"https://wahapedia.ru/wh40k11ed/factions/aeldari/#Strength-from-Death","targeting":{"side":"friendly","range":null,"scope":"unit","version":1,"verified":false,"conditions":["Lethal Intent: at the end of your opponent’s Shooting phase, if a friendly Ynnari unit died that phase, select one friendly Ynnari Infantry OR Mounted unit that was within 6 inches of the destroyed unit.","Lethal Surge modifies Fade Back for a Ynnari unit once per turn.","Lethal Reprisal: at the start of the Fight phase, select one friendly non-Titanic Ynnari unit below Starting Strength.","These are separate target clauses; do not combine their keywords, distances or counts."],"visibility":"not-required","excludedKeywords":[],"requiredKeywords":[]},"conditions":["You may include YNNARI without ASURYANI. Friendly non-EPIC HERO ASURYANI units gain YNNARI. Include YVRAINE and/or THE YNCARNE; one of those must be Warlord."],"detachment":"Devoted of Ynnead","targetText":"Friendly units specified by this rule’s summary.","enhancement":null,"provisional":true,"sourceLabel":"Wahapedia 11th edition · reviewed 16 November 2026","timingAudit":{"id":"remaining-practice-timing-wahapedia-2026-11-18","reason":"No unique freely activated phase/turn window is established; do not infer one from the guide slot.","status":"contextual","sources":[{"url":"https://wahapedia.ru/wh40k11ed/factions/aeldari/#Strength-from-Death","sha256":"b03efafc2361cf878e87a8218f7c0a6f2e594a1ed3895cc191d7ad9502f336e0"}],"reviewedAt":"2026-11-18","timingKeys":["[[2],\"opponent\",\"end\"]","[[2],\"opponent\",\"react\"]","[[4],\"either\",\"start\"]"],"quizEligible":false,"previousRevision":5},"triggerText":"","adminManaged":true,"importSource":{"file":"aeldari/abilities.json","name":"40kdc-data","text":"","record":{"name":"Strength from Death","scope":{"duration":"battle"},"effect":{"type":"sequence","steps":[{"type":"ability-part","effect":{"type":"conditional","effect":{"type":"move","target":"this-unit","modifier":{"distance":"D6+1","move_type":"normal"}},"condition":{"operands":[{"type":"phase-is","parameters":{"phase":"shooting"}},{"type":"player-turn-is","parameters":{"turn":"opponent-turn"}},{"type":"happened","parameters":{"event":"destroyed","object":{"owner":"friendly","all_of":["YNNARI"]},"window":"phase"}}],"operator":"and"}},"trigger":{"event":"phase-ended","optional":true,"condition":{"operands":[{"operands":[{"type":"phase-is","parameters":{"phase":"shooting"}},{"type":"player-turn-is","parameters":{"turn":"opponent-turn"}}],"operator":"and"},{"type":"matches","parameters":{"filter":{"owner":"friendly","all_of":["YNNARI"],"any_of":["INFANTRY","MOUNTED"]},"subject":"this-unit"}},{"type":"happened","parameters":{"event":"destroyed","object":{"owner":"friendly","all_of":["YNNARI"]},"window":"phase","proximity":{"of":"this-unit","range":{"inches":6}}}}],"operator":"and"}}},{"type":"ability-part","effect":{"type":"conditional","effect":{"type":"move","target":"this-unit","modifier":{"distance":"D6+1","move_type":"normal"}},"condition":{"type":"matches","parameters":{"filter":{"all_of":["YNNARI"]}}}},"trigger":{"event":"used","filter":{"id":"fade-back","kind":"manoeuvre"},"optional":true}},{"type":"ability-part","effect":{"type":"conditional","effect":{"type":"ability-grant","target":"this-unit","modifier":{"ability":"fights-first"}},"condition":{"operands":[{"type":"phase-is","parameters":{"phase":"fight"}},{"type":"strength","parameters":{"below":"starting"}}],"operator":"and"}},"trigger":{"event":"phase-started","optional":true,"condition":{"operands":[{"type":"phase-is","parameters":{"phase":"fight"}},{"type":"matches","parameters":{"filter":{"owner":"friendly","none_of":["TITANIC"]},"subject":"this-unit"}}],"operator":"and"}}}]},"version":"2025-q3","behavior":"reactive","unit_ids":[],"ability_id":"strength-from-death-aeldari","faction_id":"aeldari","supersedes":null,"authored_by":"40kdc-community","ability_type":"detachment","game_version":{"edition":"11th","dataslate":"pre-launch-provisional"},"detachment_id":"devoted-of-ynnead","source_digest":"d5c8aa218dfd966df35ee0e01db86a02654991419bdf50ff8ba6efe27f8aeb73","community_notes":"[APPROX] Encodes the three Ynnari rules: Lethal Intent (end of opponent's Shooting phase, if a YNNARI unit was destroyed that phase, a YNNARI INFANTRY/MOUNTED unit within 6\" of it makes a Normal move of D6+1\" — the within-6\" and INFANTRY/MOUNTED restrictions are not modeled); Lethal Surge (once per turn, a YNNARI unit performing the Fade Back Agile Manoeuvre may make a D6+1\" move that can end within Engagement Range — the Fade Back trigger, once-per-turn limit and engagement-range allowance are not modeled); Lethal Reprisal (start of the Fight phase, a below-Starting-Strength YNNARI unit excluding TITANIC gains Fights First). Full rule in raw-text store."},"sourceId":"strength-from-death-aeldari"},"sourceDigest":"d5c8aa218dfd966df35ee0e01db86a02654991419bdf50ff8ba6efe27f8aeb73","sourcePhases":[],"sourceRuleId":"strength-from-death-aeldari","summaryAudit":{"id":"aeldari-wahapedia-2026-11-16","sources":[{"url":"https://wahapedia.ru/wh40k11ed/factions/aeldari/#Strength-from-Death","sha256":"b03efafc2361cf878e87a8218f7c0a6f2e594a1ed3895cc191d7ad9502f336e0"}],"sourceUrl":"https://wahapedia.ru/wh40k11ed/factions/aeldari/#Strength-from-Death","reviewedAt":"2026-11-16","unresolved":false,"summaryHash":"a9e63e926396ceff718b325f1d299a4aa963026bf2dc225b08f6e053ea073875","previousRevision":3},"referenceOnly":false,"targetingAudit":{"id":"aeldari-targeting-2026-11-18","reason":"Lethal Intent, Lethal Surge and Lethal Reprisal have distinct target conditions.","status":"multiple-targets","sources":[{"url":"https://wahapedia.ru/wh40k11ed/factions/aeldari/#Strength-from-Death","sha256":"b03efafc2361cf878e87a8218f7c0a6f2e594a1ed3895cc191d7ad9502f336e0"}],"reviewedAt":"2026-11-18","previousRevision":4},"timingOverride":true,"leadingUnitRequired":false},"enabled":true,"revision":6}]